from ads_src import A,J
A("se-gropen25","Gropen, Göteborg: 'Låt mig berätta vad ni får för 25 kronor'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_gropen25",
 "Låt mig berätta vad ni får för 25 kronor härnere mellan Gropens vackra pelarvalv: Ni börjar med havets frukter i en cocktailskål: räkor, musslor och krabba. […] Sen trancherar vi vid ert bord en rostbiff […] Barn som är under 130 centilong äter för halva priset, elva kronor! Serveringsavgiften tillkommer, i ärlighetens namn. […] Vi öppnar klockan två. — Olle Bornefors. Ring oss, 17 42 40!",
 "good","Textbook 1-to-1 salesmanship from a local restaurant: one named host talks to you, puts the price first, lists every dish concretely and even admits the catch ('i ärlighetens namn'). "+J,
 [("Headline","Price + promise in the first words: 'vad ni får för 25 kronor'.","No separate headline — on Meta the first line must do this job alone.","Keep it as the hook: 'Låt mig berätta vad du får för 135 kr:'"),
  ("Hook","A personal voice ('Låt mig berätta') — a host, not a company.","—","Use the owner's real name and voice in clinic ads too (with their OK)."),
  ("Image","Text-only in the archive record; the words paint pictures (rostbiff carved at the table).","No photo described.","Add one real photo of the dish or the room — never stock."),
  ("Offer","Specific price, specific courses, kids' price by height (130 cm) — memorable and concrete.","Many details; on mobile, cut to the 3 best.","Price + 3 concrete things + the honest catch."),
  ("CTA","'Ring oss, 17 42 40!' and an opening time.","Two exclamation marks.","'Ring 17 42 40 – vi öppnar 14.00.'")])
A("se-gropenjul","Gropen: the 'sittande julbord' ad","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_gropenjul",
 "Här är ett gott förslag: I stället för att trängas kring de gående julborden i stan, skall ni komma hit till Gropen och få ett eget bord: ni sitter och vi går! […] I lugn och ro har ni njutit Gropens sittande julbord för bara 27:- (Serveringsavgiften tillkommer i ärlighetens namn.)",
 "good","Positions against the competition with a picture the reader knows (a crowded julbord) and flips it: 'ni sitter och vi går'. Concrete dishes, a price, an honest catch. "+J,
 [("Headline","'Här är ett gott förslag' — friendly.","Weak alone: no julbord, no price up front.","'Julbord där du sitter kvar – vi går. 27 kr.'"),
  ("Hook","Contrast: crowded buffet vs. your own table — a frustration everyone has felt.","Long sentences.","Lead with the contrast in ≤12 words."),
  ("Image","Not described; the words create the scene.","—","A photo of the cart arriving at a table."),
  ("Offer","Two named plates + the ham cart + cheese cart, for one price.","—","Keep: specific items sell, adjectives don't (Hopkins)."),
  ("CTA","Phone number + address.","No explicit 'boka'.","'Ring 17 42 40 och boka ditt bord.'")])
A("se-lordag","Palace: 'En lördagskväll när man struntar i TV'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_lordag",
 "En lördagskväll när man struntar i TV. När man klär upp sig lite extra. Och bara ägnar sig åt varandra. […] Vad det kostar? – Bara 88:- för två! (Service tillkommer i ärlighetens namn.) Kom två, kom fyra, kom fler – vi tänder ljusen på ert bord klockan halvåtta på lördag!",
 "good","Sells a feeling (a date night) but backs it with a menu, a price for two and an exact time. Emotion + specifics. "+J,
 [("Headline","Paints a scene the reader wants.","No offer in the first line.","Test 'Lördag 19.30: middag för två, 88 kr.'"),
  ("Hook","Short sentences, rhythm, focus on the two of you.","—","Great model for hooks: 3 short sentences."),
  ("Image","Candles and violin described in words.","—","Photo of a candle-lit table for two."),
  ("Offer","Named dishes + price for two + honest service note.","—","Keep the honest note: it builds trust."),
  ("CTA","'vi tänder ljusen på ert bord klockan halvåtta' — a vivid, specific next step.","No booking instruction in the quoted part.","Add 'Ring och boka' with the number.")])
A("se-palacegrill","Palace Grill: '6 sniglar, 3 olika smörsorter'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_palacegrill",
 "Upptäck ännu en förnäm matsedel i Palace-huset – Palace Grill! Börja med en smakbit: 6 sniglar, 3 olika smörsorter att välja på. Vill ni inte dofta vitlök, så finns här alltså annat snigelgodis. Olle Bornefors. Ring oss 17 42 40!",
 "good","Short, specific and a little funny (garlic breath). Numbers (6, 3) make it concrete. Weak spot: 'förnäm matsedel' is self-praise. "+J,
 [("Headline","'Upptäck … Palace Grill!' names the place.","'förnäm' is an adjective about yourself.","Lead with the fact: '6 sniglar, 3 smörsorter – Palace Grill'."),
  ("Hook","Humour + honesty about garlic.","—","Keep one human line like this."),
  ("Image","Not described.","—","Close-up of the snails with the 3 butters."),
  ("Offer","Concrete starter.","No price quoted.","Add the price."),
  ("CTA","Phone number.","Exclamation mark.","'Ring 17 42 40 och boka.'")])
A("se-westermans","Westermans Bar & Restaurant, Gamla stan","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_westermans",
 "Westermans Bar & Restaurant. Plain Food & Gourmet Dishes Downstairs. Wine, bar, drinks, snacks, juke box & live music upstairs. Open 17-24, 7 days a week. Old Town. On the corner of Stora Nygatan/Tyska Brinken. Tel: 10 39 00.",
 "good","Pure information a visitor needs: what's where, opening hours, the exact corner, phone. Nothing wasted. A good model for a Google Business Profile description. "+J,
 [("Headline","Name of the place.","A name isn't a benefit.","'Gamla stan: live music upstairs, dinner downstairs'."),
  ("Hook","Two floors, two moods — instantly clear.","—","Keep the structure: what you get here / there."),
  ("Image","Letterhead with photos (archive record).","—","On Meta: one photo of the live music."),
  ("Offer","Open 7 days a week = convenience.","No price or reason to come tonight.","Add one reason for today (tonight's band)."),
  ("CTA","Address + phone.","No explicit action.","'Find us on the corner of Stora Nygatan/Tyska Brinken.'")])
A("se-klippoteket","Klippoteket, Kungsgatan: 'Över 1000 frisyrer'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_klippoteket",
 "(Museum description: a young man as a sandwich board on Kungsgatan in Stockholm, with an Elvis hairstyle.) Board text: Klippoteket — Över 1000 frisyrer att välja mellan.",
 "good","A local hair salon using one number ('över 1000 frisyrer') and a walking demonstration (the man's Elvis cut) right on the street where its customers walk. "+J,
 [("Headline","One specific number: 1000.","'Choice' is weaker than 'a cut that suits you'.","Test '1000 frisyrer – vi hjälper dig välja'."),
  ("Hook","The Elvis haircut IS the hook: a demo, not a claim.","—","On Meta: a 3-second clip of a real finished cut (hair only, no body shaming)."),
  ("Image","A real person, in the street, with the 'product' on his head.","—","Use real staff/customers with permission."),
  ("Offer","Breadth of choice.","No price, no time.","Add price + 'drop-in' if true."),
  ("CTA","None — relies on walking in.","No action.","'Kom in på Kungsgatan' / 'Boka på nätet'.")])
A("se-kungenskurva","'Grattis ni som bor på rätt sida av stan' (Kungens Kurva)","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_kungenskurva",
 "Grattis ni som bor på rätt sida av stan. Kungens Kurva. (Idag har vi öppet 11.00 – 17.00 som vanligt.) PS. Alla varorna i annonsen hittar du till samma priser i Barkarby också! DS.",
 "good","Calls out the exact reader by where they live (Hopkins: the headline picks the reader), and the P.S. handles people on the 'wrong' side. Prices shown for every product. "+J,
 [("Headline","Local callout with a wink.","—","Model for local ads: 'Grattis, Solnabor:'"),
  ("Hook","Playful rivalry between parts of town.","Could exclude people — the P.S. fixes it.","Always add a line for the rest of the audience."),
  ("Image","Poster full of products with prices.","Busy.","On Meta: one product + price per ad, test several."),
  ("Offer","Prices on every item.","—","Show the price — it qualifies buyers."),
  ("CTA","Opening hours today.","No explicit action.","'Öppet idag 11–17. Välkommen.'")])
A("se-ysta","Ysta-Yrsa (1940s): free expert brochure coupon","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_ysta",
 "Insänd vidstående kupong så erhåller Ni gratis broschyren ”Rätt gödslad ger jorden mera – några råd rörande årets gödslingsplan”, författad av Agronom I. H. Bachér. […] Rätt inställd sprider Ysta-Yrsa exakt den bestämda mängden gödning lika jämnt vare sig lådan är full eller nästan tom.",
 "good","A 1940s lead magnet: a free, useful expert brochure in exchange for a coupon — exactly the 'free Google-kartan report' move. Plus a specific mechanism claim (spreads evenly whether full or nearly empty). "+J,
 [("Headline","'Gödslingsråd för vårsådden' — help, not a pitch.","—","Your version: 'Så syns din klinik i Google-kartan – gratis rapport'."),
  ("Hook","A truth the reader knows: even the best fertiliser fails if spread badly.","Long sentences.","Shorten to one line."),
  ("Image","Coupon.","—","On Meta: a picture of the report's first page."),
  ("Offer","Free brochure by a named expert (an agronomist) + catalogue.","'marknadens främsta' is an unproven superlative.","Keep the named expert, drop the superlative."),
  ("CTA","Send the coupon.","—","Today: 'Svara med ditt kliniknamn'.")])
A("se-bt","BT: 'Prova gå-staplare gratis en hel vecka'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_bt",
 "Prova själv gå-staplaren du kan åka på. […] Prova BT gå-staplare eller gå-truck gratis en hel vecka.",
 "good","Risk reversal for an expensive machine: try it free for a full week. Hopkins' sampling principle in B2B. "+J,
 [("Headline","'Prova själv' invites action and names the unique feature (you can ride it).","—","Clinic: 'Prova själv: gratis provvecka'."),
  ("Hook","The 'you can ride on it' detail is concrete and new.","—","Find the one detail no competitor says."),
  ("Image","Close-up of a man on the truck.","—","Real product, real use."),
  ("Offer","Free for a whole week.","—","A trial removes the risk of buying."),
  ("CTA","Implied: try it.","No contact step in the quoted part.","Add 'Ring/boka din provvecka'.")])
A("se-posten","Posten: 'Dollars, Drachmer eller Pesetas?'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_posten",
 "Dollars, Drachmer eller Pesetas? Växla valuta och resecheckar på över 500 postkontor. Alla plus-kunder växlar gratis.",
 "good","A question that sorts the reader (people about to travel), a number (500+ offices) and a free offer for an exact group. "+J,
 [("Headline","Question in the reader's own words.","—","Model: 'Ny i Stockholm och behöver tandläkare?'"),
  ("Hook","Instantly relevant to travellers.","—","—"),
  ("Image","Two older men, one holding a sausage — memorable.","Unclear link to the offer.","Picture the benefit."),
  ("Offer","'Alla plus-kunder växlar gratis' — free for a defined group.","—","Free for a clear group = specific."),
  ("CTA","Implied: go to a post office.","No explicit action.","'Växla på närmaste postkontor.'")])
A("se-upptack","Sveriges Turistråd: 'Titta där!' (Upptäck Sverige)","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_upptack",
 "I Orsa finns Europas största björnpark. Zoo i Eskilstuna har världens största leopardanläggning. […] Gratis tidning! I ”Upptäck Sverige” kan du läsa mer […] Hämta gratis på turistbyrån eller närmaste Statoil-station.",
 "good","Long copy that works because every line is a specific fact with a place name — then a free magazine as the next step. "+J,
 [("Headline","'Titta där!' — playful.","Says nothing alone.","Lead with the best fact: 'Europas största björnpark finns i Orsa.'"),
  ("Hook","Specific claims with place names.","Superlatives need sources.","Use facts you can prove."),
  ("Image","Photos of animals.","—","—"),
  ("Offer","Free magazine, 3 ways to get it.","—","Free first step."),
  ("CTA","Where to pick it up.","Three options dilute the action.","Pick one main action.")])
A("se-robertson","Robertson roofing: '40 års erfarenhet'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_robertson",
 "40-års erfarenhet från hela världen till köparens disposition. Robertsons takplåt, ventilatorer och plåtfönster ha sedan 40 år funnit användning över hela världen […] Verkets service-avdelning ställer gratis denna erfarenhet till alla köpares förfogande genom råd och anvisningar […]",
 "bad","Proof (40 years) and free advice are good ingredients, but it's written from the company's side in long, formal sentences, with no reader callout and no clear next step. "+J,
 [("Headline","A number: 40 years.","About the company, not the reader's problem.","'Bygger du lager? Gratis råd om tak och ventilation.'"),
  ("Hook","—","Formal, long, company-centred.","One short line about the reader's project."),
  ("Image","Not described.","—","Photo of a real building with the roof."),
  ("Offer","Free advice from the service department.","Buried at the end.","Put the free advice first."),
  ("CTA","None.","No action.","'Ring vår serviceavdelning för gratis råd.'")])
A("se-elmqvist","Elmqvist & Roll goldsmiths: name-and-address card","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_elmqvist",
 "ELMQVIST & ROLL. NY GEMENSAM BUTIK OCH SMEDJA. GULDSMED MARIA ELMQVIST O GULDSMED GLENN ROLL. TEGNÉRG 17 […] STOCKHOLM […] ÖPPET MÅNDAG TILL FREDAG 11-17.",
 "bad","A business card, not an ad: names, address and hours — useful facts, but no reason to come, no benefit, no offer. "+J,
 [("Headline","News: a new shared shop.","Names instead of a benefit.","'Ny guldsmedja på Tegnérgatan: se din ring smidas.'"),
  ("Hook","—","Nothing for the reader.","Show what's unique: two goldsmiths, a workshop you can see."),
  ("Image","Big red and black text.","—","Photo of the goldsmiths at work."),
  ("Offer","None.","—","A first-visit offer (example: free ring cleaning)."),
  ("CTA","Hours only.","—","'Kom förbi mån–fre 11–17.'")])
A("se-sturegallerian","Sturegallerian: 'Går det fortfarande att vara modest?'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_sturegallerian",
 "Nuförtiden går det mode i det mesta. Går det fortfarande att vara modest? I Sturegallerian finns det sex herrmodebutiker som har öppet varje dag. Norges nationaldag är inget undantag.",
 "bad","A pun (mode/modest) and a vague question. The useful fact (6 men's shops, open every day, even on a holiday) hides in line 3. Clever rarely beats clear. "+J,
 [("Headline","Wordplay.","Too clever, unclear.","'6 herrbutiker, öppet varje dag – även 17 maj.'"),
  ("Hook","—","Reader has to decode it.","Say the fact first."),
  ("Image","Illustrated suit.","—","—"),
  ("Offer","Open every day.","Weak and hidden.","Make convenience the headline."),
  ("CTA","None.","—","'Välkommen till Sturegallerian idag.'")])
A("se-axlins","Axlins Stockholm: 'två frihandelszoner i världens näst dyraste stad'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_axlins",
 "I dag öppnar Skåne två frihandelszoner i världens näst dyraste stad. […] Vi säljer traktorlass av Sveriges billigaste TV, Video, HiFi, PC […] öppet 11-21. Tag med dig 0 kr, vi öppnar Axlins-konto medan du väntar.",
 "good","News + bold positioning (cheap prices in an expensive city) + prices + hours + a 0-kr way to buy. Loud, but every line sells. Superlatives ('Sveriges billigaste') would need proof today. "+J,
 [("Headline","News ('I dag öppnar') and a big idea.","Superlative claim needs evidence.","Keep the news frame; prove price claims with real prices."),
  ("Hook","Regional pride: Skåne vs Stockholm.","—","—"),
  ("Image","Products with old and new prices, two maps.","Busy.","One product + price per ad."),
  ("Offer","Reduced prices + account opened on the spot.","'så långt lagret räcker' is vague.","State the real quantity or date."),
  ("CTA","Location + hours + 'Tag med dig 0 kr'.","—","Good: removes the money objection.")])
A("se-skaga","Skaga glasses: 'Skaga & vårmodet'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_skaga",
 "Skaga & vårmodet. I vår gäller Classic Noveau – de klassiska idealen kryddade med nya och personliga accessoarer. Elegant och nonchalant. […] Herrarnas glasögonbågar är små och runda.",
 "bad","Editorial fashion talk ('elegant och nonchalant') instead of a reason to buy. No price, no place, no action. Fine for brand mood, weak as direct response. "+J,
 [("Headline","Season + brand.","No benefit.","'Små, runda bågar – vårens herrmodell' + price."),
  ("Hook","—","Abstract adjectives.","One concrete detail: model name + colour."),
  ("Image","Real models wearing named frames.","—","Good: named models (Orion, Yuppie, Arne)."),
  ("Offer","None.","—","Price or a free try-on."),
  ("CTA","None.","—","'Prova i butik' + address.")])
A("se-stomatol","Stomatol: 'En förtjusande varelse'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_stomatol",
 "En förtjusande varelse. Till stor del tack vare de vackra tänderna. […] Framstående tandläkare rekommendera sedan årtionden […] Stomatol Tand-Crème […] Varför då inte ha vackra, vita tänder i stället för gula och vanvårdade?",
 "bad","A real Swedish dental-care ad that leans on appearance insecurity ('gula och vanvårdade') and vague authority ('framstående tandläkare'). Today that framing is exactly what Meta's health & wellness ad standards restrict. "+J,
 [("Headline","Emotional end result.","Ties a person's worth to their looks.","Speak about care, not worth."),
  ("Hook","—","Negative self-image.","Talk about habit and care, never shame."),
  ("Image","Not described.","—","Product + a smiling person, no comparison."),
  ("Offer","None.","—","A sample tube (Hopkins)."),
  ("CTA","'Börja … idag'.","—","'Prova idag'.")],note="Policy lesson: compare with Meta's Health and Wellness standards.")
A("se-caputan1","Caputan: 'Detta är metoden som gör er fri från mjäll'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_caputan1",
 "Detta är metoden som gör er fri från mjäll. (Museum description: a series of three pictures of a man being shampooed.) (utan att håret blir fett och luktar illa) […] Caputan metoden",
 "good","Names a mechanism ('Caputan-metoden'), shows it in 3 pictures and handles the objection (greasy, smelly hair). Strong structure; the absolute promise ('fri från mjäll') would need qualifying on Meta today. "+J,
 [("Headline","A method + a specific outcome.","Absolute result promise.","'Metoden mot mjäll – utan fett hår'."),
  ("Hook","Mechanism = a new reason to believe (Schwartz).","—","—"),
  ("Image","3-step picture series — a demo.","—","Perfect format for a 3-scene video."),
  ("Offer","—","No price or sample.","Add a sample size."),
  ("CTA","—","None.","'Prova metoden i 2 veckor.'")])
A("se-caputan2","Caputan: 'Är mjäll ärftligt?'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_caputan2",
 "Är mjäll ärftligt? Vad är mjäll? Varifrån kommer dom? Smittar mjäll? Kan man få mjäll i skägget? Får man mer mjäll om man är stressad? (Osv.) Caputan mot mjäll. Shampo. Hårvatten. Läggningsvätska.",
 "good","Uses the exact questions people ask — an FAQ as an ad. Great for curiosity and relevance. "+J,
 [("Headline","A real question people wonder about.","—","Clinic model: 'Hur många laserbehandlingar behövs egentligen?'"),
  ("Hook","A list of real questions keeps people reading.","Long on mobile.","Use 3 questions max."),
  ("Image","Not described.","—","—"),
  ("Offer","Product range.","No offer.","Add the answers + a free guide."),
  ("CTA","—","None.","'Läs svaren' / 'Fråga oss'.")])
A("se-tandvard","Dental ad: 'Det största hotet mot dina tänder kan vara tandborstningen'","SE","ad","real_archive","dm_tandvard",
 "Det största hotet mot dina tänder kan vara tandborstningen. Du behöver inte oroa dig. Forts.",
 "good","A surprising, contrarian headline about something everyone does daily, followed at once by reassurance. Curiosity tied to self-interest (Caples). "+J,
 [("Headline","Surprise + 'dina tänder' = self-interest.","Fear angle — keep it calm.","Keep the reassurance right after."),
  ("Hook","'Du behöver inte oroa dig' calms the fear it created.","—","—"),
  ("Image","Toothbrushes, teeth, floss, a timer.","—","A demo of correct brushing time."),
  ("Offer","Not in the quoted part.","—","—"),
  ("CTA","'Forts.' (continues).","—","On Meta: 'Se hur du borstar rätt på 2 minuter.'")])
